1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
iPhone upayogikkunnavarkku moonnu kidilan feature-ukalaanu innathe videoyiloode parichayappaduthunnathu.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,800
Appo video skip cheyyathe muzhuvanayittu kaanuka.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:12,200
Theerchayayum iPhone upayogikkunna oro aalukalkkum ee video useful aayirikkum.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:18,200
Ithil parayunna feature-ukal inno innaleyo vanna feature-ukalonnumalla, iOS 27 vannappol thudangiya feature-ukalaanu.

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,200
Appol ariyathavarkku vendi avarilekku ethikkuka ennulla uddeshyathodukoodeyaanu ee video cheyyunnathu.

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,800
Appo enthayalum kazhivathum paramavadhi ellavarilekkum share cheythu kodukkuka.

7
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,200
Appo enthellaamanu ee feature-ukal ennu nokkam.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Welcome to Mega Byte.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,400
Puthiya oru videoyilekku ellavarkkum swaagatham.

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,200
Appo ee feature-ukal nammude phoninte screen demo-yiloode namukkannu parichayappadam.

11
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,500
Ettavum aadyamayi valare useful aayittulla oru feature aanu.

12
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:50,800
Athava ningalkku aarengilum miss call nalki athallengil pinneedu eppozhengilum call back cheyyanam ennulla oru aavashyam ningalkku vannu.

13
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:55,200
Udaharanathinu njan ivide kaanikkunna ee oru contact-inu enikku oru miss call vannirikkukayaanu.

14
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,500
Ente free time-il ivarkku thirichu vilikkanam ennulla oru reminder set cheyyanam.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:06,200
Athinuvendi ningalkku ethu call-aano vendathu athinu nere ithe reethiyil idathuvashaththekk swipe cheythu kazhinjal...

16
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,800
Ivideyaayi namukku oru clock icon kaanaan sadhikkum.

17
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:14,200
Just athil select cheythu kazhinjal ningalkku eathengilum oru samayam select cheythu...

18
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,200
Athinu reminder set cheyyan sadhikkum.

19
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:23,800
Ningalkku custom aayittu venamengil ithe reethiyil ettavum avasaanathilulla 'Remind Me Later' ennulla aa option select cheythu kazhinjal...

20
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:29,200
Ivide ninnu ningalkku ethu samayathaanu vendathu ennullathu set cheyyan sadhikkum; date athupole time.

21
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:36,000
Ini urgent aanu ennundenkil aa oru notification-um enable cheythu vechu kazhinjal theerchayaayum phone oru alarm reethiyil ningalkku buzzer cheyyunnathaayirikkum.

22
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Anganeyulla ethu aavashyamaano vendathu ennullathu ivide ninnu oronnoronnayi set cheyyam.

23
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Puthiya list add cheyyanamengil athilekkum add cheythu kodukkam.

24
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Pinneedu ningal reminder cheythathinu aa samayathu ningalkku notification labhikkum.

25
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:54,800
Ini athine eppozhengilum reminder cheyyendathilla, ningalathu cheythittundu engil...

26
00:01:54,800 --> 00:02:01,800
Athe contact-inu nere onnukoodi idathuvashaththekk swipe cheythu veendum athe clock icon-il select cheythu kazhinjal...

27
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:08,000
Ivide ninnu aa reminder edit cheyyano athallengil aa reminder complete aayittundu ennu mark cheyyano sadhikkum.

28
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,200
Valare useful aayittullathalle?

29
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,800
Ishttappettittundenkil like cheyyan madikkeruthe.

30
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:15,500
Ini aduthathum valare pradhanappetta onnanu.

31
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:20,500
Athava ningal evideyengilum eathengilum oru sthalathu ningal nilkkumbol ningalkku oru call varikayanenkil...

32
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:24,000
Athinulla surrounding-ilulla noise ningale shallyappeduthunnu,

33
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,500
Athallengil background-ile shabdam avar kettu kazhinjal ningal evideyanu nilkkunnathu ennullathu avar manassilakkum ennulla pedi ningalkkundenkil...

34
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,800
Athinum ivide oru solution undu. Valare simple aanu.

35
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:36,500
Ningalude phoninte Settings-ilekku povuka.

36
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:40,000
Settings-il ninnum Accessibility ennulla option select cheyyuka.

37
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,800
Athil ninnu kurachu thaazhekk scroll cheythu poyi kazhinjal ningalkku ivideyaayi 'Audio & Visual' ennulla oru option labhikkunnathayirikkum.

38
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,800
Athu select cheyyuka.

39
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:56,000
Athu select cheythu kazhinju kurachonnu thaazhekk ponthichu kazhinjal ivideyaayi 'Voice Isolation' ennulla oru option ningalkku kaanan sadhikkum.

40
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,800
Athinu nereyulla button enable cheythu kazhinjal ningal itharathilulla crowd-ilo athallengil...

41
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:06,200
Eathengilum program-ilokke nilkkukayanenkil, mattevideyengilumokke poyittullathaanu engil...

42
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:13,800
Aa oru surrounding-ilulla shabdam poorrnnamayi isolate cheythu ningal parayunna shabdam mathram call receive cheyyunna aalukalkku kelkkum.

43
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:17,500
Atharathil namukku set cheyyan sadhikkunna oru kidilan option aanithu.

44
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:20,000
Aavashyamullavarkku set cheyyam.

45
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,800
Moonnamathathu mattoru kidilan option aanu.

46
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:31,000
Athava ningalude iPhone-ilekku aarengilum call cheythu hold cheythu vechirikkukayaanu engil aa hold-ine ningal avar unhold cheyyunnathu vare kaathirikkendathilla.

47
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:37,200
Namukku valare pettennu thanne aa hold cheythathine pause cheythukondu aa oru call veendum thirichu varunna samayathu,

48
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:42,200
Athava unhold cheyyunna samayathu namukku athinte notification labhikkukayum...

49
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:46,800
Pinneedu athu namukku eduthu samsaarichaal mathravum mathiyaakum.

50
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:52,200
Atharathilulla oru feature aanu. Ithu valare useful aakunna oru feature aanu.

51
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:57,200
Njan ippo ente ee oru phonil ninnu ente iPhone-ilekku call cheyyukayanu.

52
00:03:57,200 --> 00:04:02,800
Ee phonilekku njan call cheythu. Aa call ivide attend cheythu koduthu.

53
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:07,500
Ee phonile call-ine njan hold cheythu vekkunnu.

54
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:14,200
Hold cheythappol hold vanna aa oru notification ningalkku kelkkan sadhikkum.

55
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:20,800
Appo namukku cheyyanullathu ivide kaanunna More ennulla option select cheythu kazhinjal...

56
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:27,500
Ivideyaayi 'Hold Assist' ennulla oru option undu. Athu select cheythu kazhinjal...

57
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:31,800
Aa call ithe reethiyil assist aavukayum,

58
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:38,500
Pinneedithu hold ozhivakkunna samayathu ithe reethiyil ring cheyyukayum cheyyum.

59
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:47,500
Hold ozhivakkiyappol namukku ring cheyyukayum pinneedu namukku accept cheythu pinneedu samsaarikkayum cheyyam.

60
00:04:47,500 --> 00:04:50,500
Kandille? Ithum valare useful aayittulla feature alle?

61
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:56,500
Appo ivide paranja moonnu option-ukalum valare useful aayittullathanu athiloru samshayavum illa.

62
00:04:56,500 --> 00:05:02,500
Appo enthayalum njan itharam nirantharam itharathilulla videokal nammude channel-iloode upload cheyyunnathaayirikkum.

63
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:06,800
Athukondu madikkkathe channel subscribe cheythu support cheyyuka.

64
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:12,200
Video ishttappettu kazhinjal like-um comment-um share-um anganeyulla yaathonnum cheyyan madikkeruthe.

65
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:17,200
Athokkeyaanu enikku veendum videokal cheyyan vendi labhikkunna prajodhanam.

66
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:21,500
Appo enthayalum puthiya oru topic-umayittu namukku veendum kandumuuttaam.

67
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:27,500
Athuvarekkum channel subscribe cheythu kaathirikkuka. Nanni, Namaskaram.
